<item><title>Madagascar lawmakers elect Marco Tsaradia Assembly president with 129 votes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-lawmakers-elect-marco-tsaradia-assembly-c1d40d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-lawmakers-elect-marco-tsaradia-assembly-c1d40d/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The former supporter of Andry Rajoelina ran unopposed after other candidates withdrew and Firaisankina lawmakers left the chamber before voting.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:03:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar&apos;s government and parliament face decision on whistleblower bill</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-government-and-parliament-face-decision-on-c68bcc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-government-and-parliament-face-decision-on-c68bcc/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The draft protecting whistleblowers, corruption reporters and witnesses is complete, but its adoption depends on government and parliamentary bodies.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:03:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-government-and-parliament-face-decision-on-c68bcc/share.jpg" length="43931" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-government-and-parliament-face-decision-on-c68bcc/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar allocates $13 million to fight financial crime in 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-allocates-13-million-to-fight-financial-crime-in-2e2e48/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-allocates-13-million-to-fight-financial-crime-in-2e2e48/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The budget covers corruption, money laundering and drug trafficking as the finance minister leads the regional council through August 2027.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar trains 55 community actors to lead equity dialogues in Bemasoandro</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-trains-55-community-actors-to-lead-equity-86e8f3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-trains-55-community-actors-to-lead-equity-86e8f3/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The women&apos;s leadership network is using UNFPA support to build local discussions on parity in decision-making, with the same programme also reaching other towns.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar and Djibouti sign three cooperation accords</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-and-djibouti-sign-three-cooperation-accords-ad8d3b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-and-djibouti-sign-three-cooperation-accords-ad8d3b/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The texts exempt some passport holders from visas and open talks on port operations, logistics and transport infrastructure.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:16:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
